: "It's time to be evil. Build and master your dungeon, hire despicable monsters, and rise to conquer the overworld. Gaze from below as your dark tendrils creep across the land, snatching treasures from the forces of good and funding an ever growing empire. But beware! Saint Million the Hero King and his table of royal knights are always watching. Leave your dungeon weak, and a single cleave from the hero's sword will end your reign.\n\nMy Infamous Dungeon is a roguelite dungeon builder. Take time to carefully plan your dungeon, then protect it against waves of greedy heroes.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/my-infamous-dungeon", "videos": [{"id": 161288, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Ypy2ucIsJp0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ypy2ucIsJp0", "title": "My Infamous Dungeon - Official Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ypy2ucIsJp0/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}